+        Live text must be tokenized as one continuous utterance before it is
+        split into transport batches. Tokenizing every received fragment in
+        isolation changes BPE boundaries (dramatically so for English) and
+        makes the dual-track conditioning differ from regular inference.
+        """
+        dev = self._device()
+        if isinstance(token_ids, torch.Tensor):
+            ids = token_ids.to(device=dev, dtype=torch.long).reshape(-1)
+        else:
